   "text": "Ako dobijem priliku..."
  },
  {
   "start": 1237.55,
   "end": 1245.19,
   "text": "Počeću da dajem časove joge."
  },
  {
   "start": 1245.93,
   "end": 1246.67,
   "text": "Ah, ok."
  },
  {
   "start": 1248.41,
   "end": 1250.61,
   "text": "Does it sound correct?"
  },
  {
   "start": 1250.95,
   "end": 1252.93,
   "text": "Yeah, počeću da dajem, počeću da..."
  },
  {
   "start": 1254.07,
   "end": 1256.57,
   "text": "Yeah. Radim, dajem."
  },
  {
   "start": 1256.65,
   "end": 1259.61,
   "text": "Radim, časoroge dajem, predajem."
  },
  {
   "start": 1261.71,
   "end": 1263.71,
   "text": "Časove yoga was correct."
  },
  {
   "start": 1264.07,
   "end": 1264.61,
   "text": "I think that."
  },
  {
   "start": 1266.35,
   "end": 1271.93,
   "text": "I ako budem imao vremena,"
  },
  {
   "start": 1273.65,
   "end": 1276.57,
   "text": "nastavit ću da ućem srpski, naravno."
  },
  {
   "start": 1277.33,
   "end": 1281.17,
   "text": "Ako treba. That's always a good thing to do."
  },
  {
   "start": 1281.61,
   "end": 1281.91,
   "text": "it's because"
  },
  {
   "start": 1285.99,
   "end": 1287.65,
   "text": "so hard already"
  },
  {
   "start": 1290.41,
   "end": 1297.85,
   "text": "Dobro pričaš sada Zahmanjući tebe i drugi profesori"
  },
  {
   "start": 1299.63,
   "end": 1300.67,
   "text": "i teško je, it's hard"
  },
  {
   "start": 1300.67,
   "end": 1302.33,
   "text": "it's hard to do it"
  },
  {
   "start": 1302.33,
   "end": 1303.19,
   "text": "constantly"
  },
  {
   "start": 1303.19,
   "end": 1305.29,
   "text": "but you know"
  },
  {
   "start": 1305.29,
   "end": 1307.99,
   "text": "it's hard but you still"
  },
  {
   "start": 1307.99,
   "end": 1310.59,
   "text": "right now for example, Akob"
  },
  {
   "start": 1310.69,
   "end": 1317.63,
   "text": "You know, that was so confusing one year ago for me."
  },
  {
   "start": 1317.71,
   "end": 1321.31,
   "text": "Now, when I hear it, I automatically know what it means and I can"
  },
  {
   "start": 1321.31,
   "end": 1325.05,
   "text": "use it. That's the little thing that makes me, okay, I'm on the right"
  },
  {
   "start": 1325.05,
   "end": 1328.83,
   "text": "track. Yeah. The most important part is like doing it consistently."
  },
  {
   "start": 1329.97,
   "end": 1331.31,
   "text": "Reading, listening, writing."
  },
  {
   "start": 1332.07,
   "end": 1333.17,
   "text": "Grammar will come along."
  },
  {
   "start": 1333.87,
   "end": 1335.85,
   "text": "You have to understand grammar, how to use it."
  },
  {
   "start": 1335.85,
   "end": 1339.59,
   "text": "But this is more important, practical use."
  },
  {
   "start": 1339.73,
   "end": 1344.21,
   "text": "Yeah. But you must accept this is the weirdest grammar part."
  },
  {
   "start": 1346.43,
   "end": 1348.91,
   "text": "There's a can, there's a past tense."
  },
  {
   "start": 1350.45,
   "end": 1352.77,
   "text": "So confusing, but still."
  },
  {
   "start": 1354.59,
   "end": 1356.15,
   "text": "Ima sinisla, let me say."
  },
  {
   "start": 1357.49,
   "end": 1364.85,
   "text": "Okay, so I want our listeners to write their plans for 2025 in Serbian"
  },
  {
