  },
  {
   "start": 1367.77,
   "end": 1371.93,
   "text": "and I hope you will use these new words and structures that you hear"
  },
  {
   "start": 1371.93,
   "end": 1372.71,
   "text": "in this episode."
  },
  {
   "start": 1372.83,
